{
  "title": { "text": "Engines 运行时", "fontSize": 18, "color": "#FFFFFF", "background": "#006A65" },
  "style": { "background": "#F5F5F5", "padding": 12 },
  "body": [
    { "type": "notice", "text": "先拉起脚本再刷新。childScriptCount 统计尚未结束的 Engines 脚本（含页面拉起的主任务）。停任务用悬浮球 stopTask。" },
    { "type": "space", "height": 8 },
    {
      "type": "card",
      "children": [
        { "type": "text", "text": "childScriptCount", "style": { "fontWeight": "bold" } },
        { "type": "notice", "text": "{{childCount}}" },
        { "type": "text", "text": "状态", "style": { "fontWeight": "bold" } },
        { "type": "notice", "text": "{{status}}" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "space", "height": 8 },
    { "type": "button", "text": "刷新 childScriptCount", "onTap": "onRefresh" },
    { "type": "button", "text": "executeScriptStr 短任务", "onTap": "onRunStr" },
    { "type": "button", "text": "executeScript tasks/sample.js", "onTap": "onRunFile" },
    { "type": "button", "text": "closeOther", "onTap": "onCloseOther" }
  ]
}
